        "type": "text/html",
        "value": "<p><div class=\"et_pb_section et_pb_section_3 et_pb_with_background et_section_regular\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_3\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_3  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_3  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We\u2019re aware of an outage impacting the Central Auckland region.</span></p>\n<p>The cause appears to be fibre-related. We&#8217;re currently investigating and will provide more information when we can.<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"></span></p></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz/outage-impacting-the-central-auckland-region/\">Outage impacting the Central Auckland region</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz\">Network for Learning | N4L</a>.</p>"
